{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mascot horror game where a rubber chicken is your flashlight. Enhance it with strange energies to progress, survive twisted enemies, and whatever you do, don\u2019t let Squawky catch you.  <br><br><strong><u>ANNA (Player Character)</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a 9-year-old child who gets lost in a cornfield and ends up at the residence of the owners of Sunshine Farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>SUNSHINE FARMS</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sunshine Farms is going out of business. They were known for hosting pumpkin patch events, growing corn, and manufacturing rubber Squawky chicken toys. They also created the &quot;Squawk-O-Matic&quot; machine, which can modify your rubber chicken toy by adding various energies such as light, fire, water, electricity, and earth.<br><br><strong><u>SQUAWKY</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squawky is a lab experiment gone wrong. Its creators took advantage of the failed experiment and began profiting from people's curiosity to see Squawky. As a result, Squawky became increasingly hostile toward people and ultimately caused Sunshine Farms to go bankrupt. DON\u2019T GET CAUGHT BY SQUAWKY.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>RUBBER CHICKEN TOY</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/618ab5f806db8bf2507694e195aa6a41.poster.avif?t=1759371888\" width=750 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/618ab5f806db8bf2507694e195aa6a41.webm?t=1759371888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/618ab5f806db8bf2507694e195aa6a41.mp4?t=1759371888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your rubber chicken lights up when squeezed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/34fdaf0ff6b303d06bb6b4b2865f946f.poster.avif?t=1759371888\" width=750 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/34fdaf0ff6b303d06bb6b4b2865f946f.webm?t=1759371888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/34fdaf0ff6b303d06bb6b4b2865f946f.mp4?t=1759371888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your rubber chicken with different energies by using the &quot;Squawk-O-Matic&quot; machine.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3516220?t=1759371888","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3516220?t=1759371888","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/c106a9755e095881a830993f77bbb078580e386c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759371888","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/c106a9755e095881a830993f77bbb078580e386c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759371888","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mascot horror game where a rubber chicken is your flashlight. Enhance it with strange energies to progress, survive twisted enemies, and whatever you do, don\u2019t let Squawky catch you.  <br><br><strong><u>ANNA (Player Character)</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a 9-yea